{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "第二天——", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾同学，欢迎回来～」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3897", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我回来了，安洁」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不不，我不是安洁。\\n　我是浪女————！」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": "「不不，我不是安洁。　我是浪女————！」", "plain_idx": 202, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3898", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁坏掉了。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这就是传说中的“浪女————”吗。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "到底是什么意思啊，我还真搞不懂……", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「顺带一提，浪女是流浪女仆的简称哦——\\n　欸嘿，这是一个小知识」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": "「顺带一提，浪女是流浪女仆的简称哦——　欸嘿，这是一个小知识」", "plain_idx": 208, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3899", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我还没问她就给我解释了。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「以后都用这个名字来称呼你？」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。新吾同学也请用“浪女——”来称呼安洁吧」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": "「是的。新吾同学也请用“浪女——”来称呼安洁吧」", "plain_idx": 212, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3900", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、嗯。我试着努努力吧……浪女——」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知道为什么，\\n但总感觉是在做非常不好的事情。", "text_idx": 215, "plain": "不知道为什么，但总感觉是在做非常不好的事情。", "plain_idx": 216, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "之后也要跟樱乃普及一下“浪女——”的意思啊。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天晚上，家里简直惨不忍睹。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥……浪女——浪女——！”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——", "text_idx": 220, "plain": "——", "plain_idx": 220, "len": 2, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来樱乃相当喜欢这个词，\\n就算她不知道意思也在我的房间里一遍又一遍地重复。", "text_idx": 221, "plain": "看来樱乃相当喜欢这个词，就算她不知道意思也在我的房间里一遍又一遍地重复。", "plain_idx": 222, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且，加上一些喘息还莫名地有点妩媚。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "直接翻译就是：“哥哥，流浪女仆，流浪女仆——！”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": "直接翻译就是：“哥哥，流浪女仆，流浪女仆——！”", "plain_idx": 224, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "意义不明。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……怎么会变成这个样子……」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2912", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「辛苦了，纱凪。今天一个人？」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。学姐说下午过来」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2913", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2914", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这已经是我来到活动室后她第二次叹气了。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她盯着手机，满脸不满地鼓着腮帮子。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了？」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……想哭」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2915", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎？」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "意料之外的一句话吓得我再次看向她。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感觉我简直就像个没人要的孩子一样」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2916", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「无论有还是没有都一个样，\\n　感觉自己真的好无力……」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": "「无论有还是没有都一个样，　感觉自己真的好无力……」", "plain_idx": 244, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2917", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "第三次叹气后，\\n她开始摆弄挂在电话上的玩具戒指。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "第三次叹气后，她开始摆弄挂在电话上的玩具戒指。", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我说，新吾」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2918", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我真的不懂男人心啊」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2919", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「想要了解，却完全不了解……」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2920", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我试着以手中仅有的信息，\\n揣测这只她十分珍视的戒指的意义。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": "我试着以手中仅有的信息，揣测这只她十分珍视的戒指的意义。", "plain_idx": 256, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她说是别人给的。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而她现在正为不明白男人心而烦恼。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——恋爱的烦恼？", "text_idx": 259, "plain": "——恋爱的烦恼？", "plain_idx": 259, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以我贫瘠的想象力对于现状只能做出这样的联想了。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有什么我能帮上忙的地方吗？」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……告诉我什么是男人吧」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2921", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么是男人？」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我到现在为止都太不了解男人了。\\n　我觉得这样子不行」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": "「我到现在为止都太不了解男人了。　我觉得这样子不行」", "plain_idx": 266, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2922", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，新吾……你能告诉我，什么是男人吗？」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2923", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「告诉我什么是真正的男人——？」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": "「告诉我什么是真正的男人——？」", "plain_idx": 270, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2924", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，被人说了这么充满暗示性的话语，\\n　等待着你的就是……」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": "「所以，被人说了这么充满暗示性的话语，　等待着你的就是……」", "plain_idx": 273, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1617", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一个飞踢吗」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1618", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然我还是大意了」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「忽然说什么“告诉我什么是男人”，\\n　下一个瞬间就来了一个飞踢，怎么也预想不到啊」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "「忽然说什么“告诉我什么是男人”，　下一个瞬间就来了一个飞踢，怎么也预想不到啊」", "plain_idx": 279, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1619", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没想到等待我的却是意想之外的一击。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我完全不理解她都在想些什么。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉，这次我不是说对你有什么怨恨」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2925", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说，小乾为什么要做这种事情啊？\\n　女孩子穿着裙子做飞踢可不太好吧」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "「话说，小乾为什么要做这种事情啊？　女孩子穿着裙子做飞踢可不太好吧」", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1620", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太因为要协助学生会，所以在星期六的今天也来学校了。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我在活动室被踹飞的时候，\\n刚好同时收到了来自隼太的那条“回去的时候一起去吃个饭吧～？”的短信。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": "我在活动室被踹飞的时候，刚好同时收到了来自隼太的那条“回去的时候一起去吃个饭吧～？”的短信。", "plain_idx": 290, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为我听说男人是用拳头说话的生物」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2926", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以就觉得真正的男人应该强大到我根本敌不过才对……」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": "「所以就觉得真正的男人应该强大到我根本敌不过才对……」", "plain_idx": 293, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2927", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是，我感觉你应该是有很多的误会，\\n　你怎么说，新吾？」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": "「不是，我感觉你应该是有很多的误会，　你怎么说，新吾？」", "plain_idx": 296, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1621", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是能找到一个和平的方法，\\n　告诉她什么是真正的男人就好了」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": "「要是能找到一个和平的方法，　告诉她什么是真正的男人就好了」", "plain_idx": 299, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说到底，到底什么是真正的男人啊？」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1622", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「问题就在这儿了」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我感觉这是不能用语言来描述的东西。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "话虽如此，用拳头来说话也太出格了……", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小乾心目中的男人是怎样的形象？」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": "「小乾心目中的男人是怎样的形象？」", "plain_idx": 305, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1623", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在我的印象里……吵吵闹闹的，\\n　经常使用暴力，自己想干嘛干嘛，\\n　表面温柔，其实肚子里全是坏水……」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": "「在我的印象里……吵吵闹闹的，　经常使用暴力，自己想干嘛干嘛，　表面温柔，其实肚子里全是坏水……」", "plain_idx": 308, "len": 53, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2928", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜哇——这个样子，怪不得会讨厌男人啊」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1624", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这下难办了。再怎么说明，\\n　这样的成见也是相当不好消除的……」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": "「这下难办了。再怎么说明，　这样的成见也是相当不好消除的……」", "plain_idx": 313, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但不是有一条格外简单的方法来帮她理解男人吗？」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1625", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你有什么好的想法吗？」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只要平常注意观察新吾就行了吧。\\n　根本没有逐一用语言说明的必要啦」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": "「只要平常注意观察新吾就行了吧。　根本没有逐一用语言说明的必要啦」", "plain_idx": 318, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1626", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「观察新吾？然后就能理解男人了？」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2929", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以的可以的。我心爱的新吾肯定会好好教给你\\n　什么叫真正的男人的」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": "「可以的可以的。我心爱的新吾肯定会好好教给你　什么叫真正的男人的」", "plain_idx": 323, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1627", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……隼太，你是认真这么说的？」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么意思嘛。你不会没自信吧～？」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1628", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最起码我可没有对她的飞踢做出反击的“男子气概”」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": "「最起码我可没有对她的飞踢做出反击的“男子气概”」", "plain_idx": 328, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那不就更应该选你了吗」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1629", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小乾，一下都不可以将目光从新吾身上离开哦？」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1630", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「常言道，个个男性通新吾嘛」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1631", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没这话吧」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看这个情况，似乎隼太也没有什么好的方案。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我还是自己稍微再想想看吧」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2930", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也许这样更好」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉，隼太。打扰到你学生会的工作了……」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗨呀，不用在意。下次再一起吃饭吧」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1632", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为了教会小乾什么是男人，\\n　你可得好好努力啊」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": "「为了教会小乾什么是男人，　你可得好好努力啊」", "plain_idx": 344, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1633", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我会尽我最大努力的」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦，这样才像你嘛」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1634", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我收到这不知道是激励还是泼冷水的支援后，\\n便离开了教室。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": "我收到这不知道是激励还是泼冷水的支援后，便离开了教室。", "plain_idx": 350, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我也走了。\\n　不过，真的只要看着新吾就能理解男人了吗？」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": "「那我也走了。　不过，真的只要看着新吾就能理解男人了吗？」", "plain_idx": 352, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2931", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么说呢。总之，我唯一能说的就是……」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1635", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「并不是打架厉害的家伙才更男人」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1636", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「比如说，对了……\\n　新吾他，在你飞踢过来的时候有躲开过吗？」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": "「比如说，对了……　新吾他，在你飞踢过来的时候有躲开过吗？」", "plain_idx": 359, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1637", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……没有」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2932", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对吧——因为要是他躲开了，你可就要受伤了」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1638", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？！」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2933", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「再顺便提一嘴，最后他还成了你落地的肉垫对吧？」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": "「再顺便提一嘴，最后他还成了你落地的肉垫对吧？」", "plain_idx": 367, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1639", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2934", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哪怕做到这样，\\n　也不想让小乾你受伤啊，那个家伙」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": "「哪怕做到这样，　也不想让小乾你受伤啊，那个家伙」", "plain_idx": 372, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1640", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，为什么他不惜做到这地步也要保护我这种……」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2935", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这就是——那个嘛」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1641", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为新吾是男生，小乾你是女生嘛」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1642", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2936", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「的确，新吾讨厌争斗，\\n　乍一看的话也许不会觉得他有男子气概……」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": "「的确，新吾讨厌争斗，　乍一看的话也许不会觉得他有男子气概……」", "plain_idx": 383, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1643", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但让我来说的话，\\n　他的男子气概可是连同性都会不禁着迷呢」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": "「但让我来说的话，　他的男子气概可是连同性都会不禁着迷呢」", "plain_idx": 386, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1644", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你和隼太说了什么啊？」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说你的坏话」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2937", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那幸好我没回教室了」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2938", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了吗？」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "走在我侧边的纱凪停下了脚步，我也随即停下。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从身后的教室里，我还能听见隼太在哼着逍遥自在的鼻歌。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果是隼太的话，就算被飞踢了也肯定是那样\\n　哼着歌就算过去了吧」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": "「如果是隼太的话，就算被飞踢了也肯定是那样　哼着歌就算过去了吧」", "plain_idx": 397, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……男人都是这样的吗？」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2939", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也不是」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是你也是……哪怕我做了那样的事情，\\n　你也没有来复仇什么的……」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": "「但是你也是……哪怕我做了那样的事情，　你也没有来复仇什么的……」", "plain_idx": 402, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2940", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那你觉得你和美羽学姐是同样的女生吗？」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2941", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以这也一样，男人里也有各种各样的人。\\n　我也不能很好地用语言来教会你啊」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": "「所以这也一样，男人里也有各种各样的人。　我也不能很好地用语言来教会你啊」", "plain_idx": 408, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……这样。无论男人女人，都不是这么简单的呢」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2942", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，为什么你想要知道男人是什么呢？」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这个……」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2943", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是想改正自己对男性的厌恶吗？」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是这样的。非要说的话，恰恰相反」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2944", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶？」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想成为一个真正的男人——」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": "「我想成为一个真正的男人——」", "plain_idx": 418, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn2945", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
